    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Identify phenotypically or genetically intermediate natural populations and compare their abundance or occupancy with the two endpoint forms under standardized sampling. Lower abundance of intermediates across systems supports the claim; equal or greater abundance refutes it.";
